{"id":"264cfff82242245c","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-structure.md","title":"First-Order Structures","display":"df-structure — First-Order Structures","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-structure","aliases":["90-df-structure"],"display":"df-structure — First-Order Structures","depends_on":["[[90-df-language]]","[[90-df-relation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-structure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-structure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-structure — First-Order Structures"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f2f6e5380b315983\" href=\"?note=f2f6e5380b315983\" title=\"90-df-language\">90-df-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4badec96813b3395\" href=\"?note=4badec96813b3395\" title=\"90-df-relation\">90-df-relation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Lang}(\\Lambda)\">\\(\\operatorname{Lang}(\\Lambda)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Lambda=\\langle C,(F_n)_{n\\ge1},(R_n)_{n\\ge1}\\rangle\">\\(\\Lambda=\\langle C,(F_n)_{n\\ge1},(R_n)_{n\\ge1}\\rangle\\)</span>。候选结构为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M=\\langle A,c,(f_n)_{n\\ge1},(r_n)_{n\\ge1}\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal M=\\langle A,c,(f_n)_{n\\ge1},(r_n)_{n\\ge1}\\rangle\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A^{A^n}\">\\(A^{A^n}\\)</span> 表示全函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A^n\\to A\">\\(A^n\\to A\\)</span> 的集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(A^n)\">\\(\\mathcal P(A^n)\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 元关系的集合。一元解释允许原一元组与元素的规范识别。</li>\n<li>下式解释分量和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathcal M)\">\\(\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathcal M)\\)</span> 只对满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_\\Lambda\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_\\Lambda\\)</span> 的结构调用；此处 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}\">\\(\\operatorname{dom}\\)</span> 是结构底集投影，不是把四元组视为二元关系图。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Struct}_\\Lambda(\\mathcal M)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists A\\ \\exists c\\ \\exists(f_n)_{n\\ge1}\\ \\exists(r_n)_{n\\ge1}\\ \\Bigl[\n\\mathcal M=\\langle A,c,(f_n)_{n\\ge1},(r_n)_{n\\ge1}\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land A\\ne\\varnothing\\land c:C\\to A\n\\land\\forall n\\ge1\\ (f_n:F_n\\to A^{A^n}\\land r_n:R_n\\to\\mathcal P(A^n))\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathcal M)&amp;\\coloneqq A,\\qquad C^{\\mathcal M}\\coloneqq c,\\qquad\nF_n^{\\mathcal M}\\coloneqq f_n,\\qquad R_n^{\\mathcal M}\\coloneqq r_n,\\\\\na^{\\mathcal M}&amp;\\coloneqq C^{\\mathcal M}(a)\\quad(a\\in C),\\\\\nf^{\\mathcal M}&amp;\\coloneqq F_n^{\\mathcal M}(f)\\quad(f\\in F_n),\\\\\nR^{\\mathcal M}&amp;\\coloneqq R_n^{\\mathcal M}(R)\\quad(R\\in R_n),\\\\\n\\mathcal M\\upharpoonright\\Lambda&#39;&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\langle A,c\\upharpoonright C&#39;,(f_n\\upharpoonright F&#39;_n)_{n\\ge1},(r_n\\upharpoonright R&#39;_n)_{n\\ge1}\\rangle\n\\quad(\\Lambda&#39;=\\langle C&#39;,(F&#39;_n),(R&#39;_n)\\rangle\\subseteq\\Lambda),\\\\\n\\Lambda&#39;\\subseteq\\Lambda\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_\\Lambda(\\mathcal M)&amp;\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Struct}_{\\Lambda&#39;}(\\mathcal M\\upharpoonright\\Lambda&#39;).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Struct}_\\Lambda(\\mathcal M)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists A\\ \\exists c\\ \\exists(f_n)_{n\\ge1}\\ \\exists(r_n)_{n\\ge1}\\ \\Bigl[\n\\mathcal M=\\langle A,c,(f_n)_{n\\ge1},(r_n)_{n\\ge1}\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land A\\ne\\varnothing\\land c:C\\to A\n\\land\\forall n\\ge1\\ (f_n:F_n\\to A^{A^n}\\land r_n:R_n\\to\\mathcal P(A^n))\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathcal M)&amp;\\coloneqq A,\\qquad C^{\\mathcal M}\\coloneqq c,\\qquad\nF_n^{\\mathcal M}\\coloneqq f_n,\\qquad R_n^{\\mathcal M}\\coloneqq r_n,\\\\\na^{\\mathcal M}&amp;\\coloneqq C^{\\mathcal M}(a)\\quad(a\\in C),\\\\\nf^{\\mathcal M}&amp;\\coloneqq F_n^{\\mathcal M}(f)\\quad(f\\in F_n),\\\\\nR^{\\mathcal M}&amp;\\coloneqq R_n^{\\mathcal M}(R)\\quad(R\\in R_n),\\\\\n\\mathcal M\\upharpoonright\\Lambda&#39;&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\langle A,c\\upharpoonright C&#39;,(f_n\\upharpoonright F&#39;_n)_{n\\ge1},(r_n\\upharpoonright R&#39;_n)_{n\\ge1}\\rangle\n\\quad(\\Lambda&#39;=\\langle C&#39;,(F&#39;_n),(R&#39;_n)\\rangle\\subseteq\\Lambda),\\\\\n\\Lambda&#39;\\subseteq\\Lambda\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_\\Lambda(\\mathcal M)&amp;\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Struct}_{\\Lambda&#39;}(\\mathcal M\\upharpoonright\\Lambda&#39;).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本文件依据第 90 本实际调用的接口补齐未提供的外部依赖，供本书内部使用；不声称复原未提供的外部原文。 此四元组分量顺序与原标准算术结构及约化定义一致；非逻辑符号不是其解释函数本身。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-language","status":"resolved","id":"f2f6e5380b315983","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-relation","status":"resolved","id":"4badec96813b3395","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-relation]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Lang}(\\Lambda)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Lambda=\\langle C,(F_n)_{n\\ge1},(R_n)_{n\\ge1}\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal M=\\langle A,c,(f_n)_{n\\ge1},(r_n)_{n\\ge1}\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"A^{A^n}","display":false},{"tex":"A^n\\to A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(A^n)","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathcal M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struct}_\\Lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{dom}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Struct}_\\Lambda(\\mathcal M)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists A\\ \\exists c\\ \\exists(f_n)_{n\\ge1}\\ \\exists(r_n)_{n\\ge1}\\ \\Bigl[\n\\mathcal M=\\langle A,c,(f_n)_{n\\ge1},(r_n)_{n\\ge1}\\rangle\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land A\\ne\\varnothing\\land c:C\\to A\n\\land\\forall n\\ge1\\ (f_n:F_n\\to A^{A^n}\\land r_n:R_n\\to\\mathcal P(A^n))\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathcal M)&\\coloneqq A,\\qquad C^{\\mathcal M}\\coloneqq c,\\qquad\nF_n^{\\mathcal M}\\coloneqq f_n,\\qquad R_n^{\\mathcal M}\\coloneqq r_n,\\\\\na^{\\mathcal M}&\\coloneqq C^{\\mathcal M}(a)\\quad(a\\in C),\\\\\nf^{\\mathcal M}&\\coloneqq F_n^{\\mathcal M}(f)\\quad(f\\in F_n),\\\\\nR^{\\mathcal M}&\\coloneqq R_n^{\\mathcal M}(R)\\quad(R\\in R_n),\\\\\n\\mathcal M\\upharpoonright\\Lambda'&\\coloneqq\n\\langle A,c\\upharpoonright C',(f_n\\upharpoonright F'_n)_{n\\ge1},(r_n\\upharpoonright R'_n)_{n\\ge1}\\rangle\n\\quad(\\Lambda'=\\langle C',(F'_n),(R'_n)\\rangle\\subseteq\\Lambda),\\\\\n\\Lambda'\\subseteq\\Lambda\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_\\Lambda(\\mathcal M)&\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Struct}_{\\Lambda'}(\\mathcal M\\upharpoonright\\Lambda').\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2194,"backlinks":[{"id":"278a6c2cfc6160a3","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"结构及解释分量取 [[90-df-structure]]，满足关系取 [[90-df-satisfaction]]。$s,t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}$；$z(s,t)$ 为下式定义的新鲜变量函数。"},{"id":"d4aaea13d19cf090","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a14c33ea0c47a173","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S$；$T\\vdash\\sigma$ 见 [[90-df-predicate-logic]]。$\\mathcal M$ 是 [[90-df-structure]] 的 $S^\\sharp$-结构，$\\models$ 取 [[90-df-satisfaction]]，签名翻译见 [[90-df-syntax-interface]]。"},{"id":"f63672a7ac0e50d2","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal M=\\langle A,C,(F_n)_{n\\ge1},(R_n)_{n\\ge1}\\rangle$ 满足 [[90-df-structure]] 的 $\\mathrm{Struct}_{(S^*)^\\sharp}(\\mathcal M)$；假设 $\\mathcal M\\upharpoonright S_{\\mathrm{arith}}=\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{arith}}$，约化在下式定义，满足关系见 [[90-df-satisfaction]]。"},{"id":"ead6ebad4464a6c6","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal M$ 满足 [[90-df-structure]] 的 $\\mathrm{Struct}_{S^\\sharp}$；$\\models$ 直接引用 [[90-df-satisfaction]]，$S^\\sharp$ 见 [[90-df-syntax-interface]]。$n\\in\\mathbb N$。"},{"id":"10ddd9c20c6edffd","anchor":"ref-28","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-structure]]"},{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-181","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-acceptable-program-numbering.md]]\n[[90-df-atomic-formula.md]]\n[[90-df-base-formula.md]]\n[[90-df-base-free-variable.md]]\n[[90-df-base-godel-numbering.md]]\n[[90-df-ce-indexing.md]]\n[[90-df-ce-set.md]]\n[[90-df-computable-function.md]]\n[[90-df-encoding.md]]\n[[90-df-hilbert-bernays.md]]\n[[90-df-iota-operator.md]]\n[[90-df-language.md]]\n[[90-df-many-one-reducible.md]]\n[[90-df-omega.md]]\n[[90-df-provable.md]]\n[[90-df-relation.md]]\n[[90-df-satisfaction.md]]\n[[90-df-structure.md]]\n[[90-df-substitution.md]]\n[[90-df-term.md]]\n[[90-df-theory.md]]\n[[90-df-tm-halts.md]]\n[[90-df-tm-output.md]]\n[[90-df-turing-machine.md]]\n[[90-df-variable.md]]\n[[90-thm-smn.md]]"}],"outgoing":["f2f6e5380b315983","4badec96813b3395"]}